  #line-at(211.32pt, 149.64pt, " (STO) thin film was transferred on GaN for potential applications in power devices ")
  #line-at(54pt, 166.8pt, "(transistor and diodes) by nanomembrane transfer method and the detailed electrical properties such as leakage current, C-V ")
  #line-at(54pt, 184.08pt, "profiles, dielectric constant, frequency dispersion was reported from fabricated MOSCAP structures. The leakage current was ")
