  #line-at(72pt, 404.04pt, "The value of the dielectric constant showed dependency on the STO thickness and contact pad size. ")
  #line-at(54pt, 424.68pt, "Thicker STO thickness (200 nm) and smaller pad size (50μm) resulted in higher k-value in all ")
  #line-at(54pt, 445.44pt, "measurements. The thickness dependance is consistent with previous reports and arises possibly due to ")
